WEBVTT

01:21.400 --> 01:26.900
[A Splendid Match]

01:27.530 --> 01:29.620
[Episode 21]

01:48.120 --> 01:49.280
Old Madam Wang

01:48.289 --> 01:51.360
[Old Madam Wang, Grandmother of Wang Zan]

01:49.870 --> 01:51.070
has been

01:51.070 --> 01:52.789
my close friend for years.

01:54.400 --> 01:55.509
Dear sis,

01:56.039 --> 01:56.720
these are

01:56.789 --> 01:58.250
my three granddaughters.

01:58.509 --> 02:00.480
Greetings, Madam Wang.

02:00.590 --> 02:02.060
Please rise at once.

02:02.230 --> 02:03.670
You're truly blessed.

02:03.920 --> 02:04.800
All your granddaughters

02:04.800 --> 02:06.630
are breathtakingly beautiful.

02:06.680 --> 02:07.280
Indeed.

02:08.150 --> 02:08.800
Zan,

02:09.360 --> 02:11.360
bring the gifts we prepared.

02:11.430 --> 02:11.960
Alright.

02:14.710 --> 02:15.280
Zhao.

02:19.079 --> 02:20.210
Thank you, Mr. Wang.

02:21.360 --> 02:23.000
No need for such formalities.

02:23.000 --> 02:24.630
Just call me Zan from now on.

02:29.800 --> 02:30.440
Well then?

02:30.520 --> 02:32.510
You can't get away from me now.

02:42.280 --> 02:43.060
Zhao,

02:43.310 --> 02:44.370
mind your manners.

02:46.360 --> 02:48.220
Grandmother, I didn't mean it.

02:48.400 --> 02:50.030
I only meant to tease him a little.

02:50.030 --> 02:51.690
Please don't take it to heart.

02:53.800 --> 02:54.800
Of course not.

02:55.030 --> 02:56.079
You kids

02:56.079 --> 02:57.079
playing around

02:57.190 --> 02:58.790
only shows how close you are.

02:59.520 --> 03:00.150
Alright.

03:00.800 --> 03:02.320
I need a private chat

03:02.430 --> 03:03.660
with Madam Wang.

03:03.910 --> 03:04.630
As for you girls,

03:04.630 --> 03:06.430
no need to stand on ceremony here.

03:06.430 --> 03:07.150
Sis,

03:07.680 --> 03:08.810
what bad luck today.

03:09.080 --> 03:10.430
Xian is still at school

03:10.870 --> 03:12.400
and can't keep Zan company.

03:13.300 --> 03:14.160
Here's an idea.

03:14.870 --> 03:15.560
Zhao,

03:15.840 --> 03:17.240
you're the eldest sister.

03:17.240 --> 03:18.840
Show Mr. Wang and the others

03:18.910 --> 03:20.190
around the garden.

03:20.840 --> 03:22.190
Treat our guest well.

03:22.350 --> 03:22.900
I will.

03:29.590 --> 03:31.320
Your grandmother's on my side.

03:38.590 --> 03:39.280
So what now?

03:39.750 --> 03:41.090
We're at your mansion.

03:41.310 --> 03:42.770
Dare you lay a finger on me?

03:44.630 --> 03:45.280
Lan,

03:45.430 --> 03:46.560
I just remembered

03:46.560 --> 03:48.280
I still have embroidery to finish.

03:48.280 --> 03:49.140
Help me with it.

03:50.310 --> 03:50.840
Huh?

03:51.630 --> 03:52.000
But…

03:52.000 --> 03:53.460
Stop hesitating, come on.

03:56.520 --> 03:57.120
See?

03:57.680 --> 03:58.430
Even your own sister

03:58.430 --> 04:00.110
is trying to match us up.

04:00.400 --> 04:02.400
Why are you still being so stubborn?

04:10.800 --> 04:12.000
Weren't we going to tour the garden?

04:12.000 --> 04:13.310
Why are you leading me to the gate?

04:13.310 --> 04:14.280
I'm sending you home.

04:14.280 --> 04:15.030
I never said I'm leaving.

04:15.030 --> 04:15.960
Stop right there!

04:15.960 --> 04:16.720
Stop!

04:17.720 --> 04:18.720
What are you up to?

04:19.390 --> 04:20.390
You know exactly.

04:21.240 --> 04:22.240
I even asked my grandmother

04:22.240 --> 04:23.040
to come here

04:23.160 --> 04:24.560
just to see you.

04:25.240 --> 04:26.430
This is the Gu Mansion,

04:26.430 --> 04:27.510
not your Wang manor.

04:27.510 --> 04:29.440
Precisely because it's your home.

04:29.600 --> 04:31.390
You're the host, I'm the guest.

04:31.800 --> 04:33.270
If you slight me,

04:33.360 --> 04:34.960
it'll make your whole family

04:35.070 --> 04:36.200
look discourteous.

04:36.950 --> 04:38.750
You're a young lady while I'm a gentleman.

04:38.750 --> 04:39.880
If we make a scene,

04:40.070 --> 04:40.990
you'll be the one

04:40.990 --> 04:42.270
losing face in the end.

04:42.870 --> 04:44.200
You have no shame at all.

04:45.310 --> 04:46.510
To tell you the truth,

04:46.800 --> 04:48.060
ever since I was a child

04:48.240 --> 04:49.430
this is just how I am.

04:49.750 --> 04:51.350
What can you even do about it?

04:53.510 --> 04:54.680
I have to admit

04:56.430 --> 04:57.680
you look quite lovely

04:57.830 --> 04:59.030
when you're annoyed.

04:59.310 --> 04:59.950
Exactly.

05:00.430 --> 05:01.630
Just like this.

05:03.120 --> 05:05.310
Such a charming angry beauty.

05:05.310 --> 05:06.430
Get away from me!

05:08.390 --> 05:09.870
Don't shy away.

05:10.310 --> 05:11.190
Leave me alone!

05:20.630 --> 05:21.480
Gu Jinzhao.

05:22.630 --> 05:24.290
Just you wait.

05:24.430 --> 05:25.040
I don't hold the silly rule

05:25.040 --> 05:26.510
of never hitting a woman.

05:32.950 --> 05:34.150
What's he doing here?

05:37.040 --> 05:38.100
Mr. Wang,

05:38.159 --> 05:39.820
how did you fall into the pond?

05:40.510 --> 05:41.390
I'm so sorry.

05:41.680 --> 05:42.630
Come out quickly.

05:42.630 --> 05:44.560
Don't get your clothes any wetter.

05:46.190 --> 05:47.070
Hurry up.

05:47.390 --> 05:48.720
Father's brought guests over.

05:48.720 --> 05:50.130
What guests?

05:52.600 --> 05:53.530
This way please.

05:54.630 --> 05:55.600
Chen Yanyun.

05:58.430 --> 05:59.720
Why is he here at your manor?

05:59.720 --> 06:01.980
Our two families are old family friends.

06:02.950 --> 06:03.830
Come on.

06:04.310 --> 06:06.970
Go to the guest courtyard.
I'll get you changed.

06:07.510 --> 06:09.310
Your mood shifts so fast.

06:09.430 --> 06:10.630
Are you coming or not?

06:12.270 --> 06:12.830
Let's go.

06:17.070 --> 06:18.360
Isn't that Zhao?

06:18.800 --> 06:20.190
Who's that soaked mess?

06:31.040 --> 06:31.920
Why'd you stop?

06:36.630 --> 06:37.510
You may head back.

06:37.510 --> 06:38.710
I've got things to do.

06:38.920 --> 06:39.750
Gu Jinzhao,

06:41.630 --> 06:43.430
I've already told my family

06:43.630 --> 06:45.630
I'll marry only you.

06:46.190 --> 06:47.650
Have you lost your senses?

06:48.510 --> 06:49.480
Grandmother came today

06:49.480 --> 06:50.870
to propose our marriage.

06:50.870 --> 06:52.130
You look down on me now,

06:52.510 --> 06:53.510
but once we're married,

06:53.510 --> 06:55.570
you'll have to stay by my side always.

06:56.190 --> 06:58.120
If I make you weep, you can't smile.

06:58.310 --> 06:59.440
If I tell you to live,

06:59.800 --> 07:00.920
you dare not die.

07:00.950 --> 07:01.510
You…

07:07.410 --> 07:08.820
Is that all you've got?

07:18.840 --> 07:20.450
If you dare marry me,

07:20.630 --> 07:22.160
I'll never let you off easy.

07:25.510 --> 07:26.360
It's all a misunderstanding.

07:26.360 --> 07:26.960
Step back.

07:29.060 --> 07:30.780
Careful now.

07:30.860 --> 07:32.120
it's quite dangerous.

07:33.800 --> 07:35.000
A misunderstanding.

07:35.159 --> 07:36.020
Step back more.

07:38.240 --> 07:39.040
Leave at once!

07:40.920 --> 07:41.570
Get out!

07:51.940 --> 07:52.790
Miss Zhao,

07:53.070 --> 07:54.510
Lord Chen has arrived at our manor.

07:54.510 --> 07:56.000
Master asks you to greet him

07:56.000 --> 07:57.659
and help attend to the guests.

07:58.630 --> 07:59.360
Understood.

08:02.680 --> 08:03.480
Wait a moment.

08:05.120 --> 08:05.950
Why has Lord Chen

08:05.950 --> 08:07.360
come so unexpectedly?

08:08.630 --> 08:09.310
Miss Zhao,

08:09.510 --> 08:10.190
Lord Chen

08:10.190 --> 08:11.870
was at the Ministry of Revenue
on official business.

08:11.870 --> 08:13.560
Our master went to report to him

08:13.560 --> 08:14.560
and talked till office hours ended,

08:14.560 --> 08:15.560
still unfinished.

08:15.560 --> 08:16.390
So Master invited

08:16.390 --> 08:18.040
Lord Chen over to our home.

08:18.190 --> 08:20.120
To our surprise, he agreed.

08:20.510 --> 08:21.360
Master is quite nervous

08:21.360 --> 08:22.630
right now.

08:23.000 --> 08:23.950
He's nervous,

08:24.680 --> 08:26.210
yet sends me to deal with it?

08:27.830 --> 08:28.920
Please don't be upset, Miss.

08:28.920 --> 08:30.510
Master has no other choice.

08:30.830 --> 08:31.950
Lord Chen mentioned

08:31.950 --> 08:33.510
craving a dish we make

08:34.120 --> 08:36.669
with sliced meat and mushrooms

08:36.840 --> 08:37.630
but couldn't recall

08:37.630 --> 08:38.549
its name.

08:38.870 --> 08:40.030
That's why Master asks

08:40.030 --> 08:42.200
you to help prepare it.

08:44.390 --> 08:45.650
I know which dish it is.

08:46.750 --> 08:47.750
It just came to me.

08:49.120 --> 08:50.670
The men are chatting in the front hall.

08:50.670 --> 08:52.360
It's improper for me to go there.

08:52.360 --> 08:53.360
Go tell Master

08:53.660 --> 08:54.240
I'll head straight

08:54.240 --> 08:55.720
to oversee the feast arrangements.

08:55.720 --> 08:56.600
I won't go pay formal respects.

08:56.600 --> 08:58.000
Miss, that's…

08:58.290 --> 08:59.550
Just tell him plainly.

08:59.670 --> 09:00.910
No one will blame you.

09:03.750 --> 09:04.390
Very well.

09:17.960 --> 09:19.160
She really said that?

09:23.510 --> 09:24.670
That stubborn girl

09:24.910 --> 09:26.370
has no regard for decency.

09:34.870 --> 09:35.600
My Lord,

09:36.340 --> 09:37.790
my daughter feels

09:37.810 --> 09:40.210
it inappropriate
to come to the front yard.

09:45.270 --> 09:47.200
She's always been rather reserved.

09:47.200 --> 09:49.870
I'll send someone to fetch her at once.

09:51.970 --> 09:53.380
It's only a simple dish.

09:54.150 --> 09:55.870
No need to trouble your daughter

09:55.870 --> 09:56.930
to come over again.

09:57.560 --> 09:58.600
Yes, of course.

09:59.510 --> 10:01.270
Maybe let my daughter

10:01.270 --> 10:02.790
supervise the kitchen.

10:02.790 --> 10:03.390
By the way,

10:03.390 --> 10:04.240
what dishes do you prefer

10:04.240 --> 10:05.770
or have any dietary taboos?

10:06.440 --> 10:07.240
Your daughter

10:07.910 --> 10:09.240
knows my tastes well.

10:13.190 --> 10:14.170
Naturally.

10:15.030 --> 10:15.870
Of course.

10:16.600 --> 10:17.750
She should know.

10:23.280 --> 10:26.440
[Eternal Glory]

10:23.440 --> 10:24.700
My deepest apologies.

10:25.270 --> 10:26.070
As you can see,

10:26.600 --> 10:28.320
we never expected Lord Chen

10:28.320 --> 10:29.790
to drop by so suddenly.

10:31.510 --> 10:33.090
It only shows

10:33.200 --> 10:35.760
how close he is to your family.

10:35.870 --> 10:38.550
He's a Grand Secretary in court.

10:38.840 --> 10:40.270
This is great news.

10:40.640 --> 10:41.720
As for the marriage proposal,

10:41.720 --> 10:42.970
I'll keep it in mind.

10:42.990 --> 10:44.340
Just wait for my reply.

10:44.600 --> 10:46.000
That would be wonderful.

10:46.320 --> 10:47.320
Please stop here.

10:48.810 --> 10:50.040
Second daughter-in-law,

10:50.040 --> 10:51.190
see our guest out.

10:52.080 --> 10:52.670
Yes.

10:53.150 --> 10:54.120
Farewell.

10:55.510 --> 10:56.150
After you.

10:56.270 --> 10:57.200
Very well.

11:05.670 --> 11:06.150
Hurry,

11:06.550 --> 11:07.630
send a fast rider

11:07.750 --> 11:09.720
to fetch Second Master
from the official office,

11:09.720 --> 11:11.120
tell him Lord Chen is here

11:11.230 --> 11:12.320
and ask him to come back right away.

11:12.320 --> 11:12.870
OK.

11:16.900 --> 11:17.970
Also find

11:18.150 --> 11:19.150
a trusted servant

11:19.510 --> 11:21.040
to the front hall to find out

11:21.240 --> 11:22.200
the best moment

11:22.200 --> 11:23.630
to meet Lord Chen.

11:24.080 --> 11:24.810
Understood.

11:27.180 --> 11:30.470
[Eternal Glory]

11:44.240 --> 11:45.440
Lord Chen.

11:47.360 --> 11:47.960
Lord Gu.

11:48.720 --> 11:50.380
It's an honor to have you here.

11:50.790 --> 11:52.630
I regret not greeting you earlier.

11:52.630 --> 11:54.360
Please pardon my discourtesy.

11:55.720 --> 11:57.380
No need for such formalities.

11:59.150 --> 11:59.870
Old Madam.

12:03.910 --> 12:04.510
What did he say?

12:04.510 --> 12:05.200
Madam,

12:05.600 --> 12:06.670
Second Master reports,

12:06.670 --> 12:08.080
Lord Chen gave special instructions

12:08.080 --> 12:09.630
not to trouble the household elders,

12:09.630 --> 12:11.030
asking you and the madam

12:11.440 --> 12:13.040
to skip the formal greeting.

12:16.200 --> 12:17.440
How could he act so aloof?

12:17.440 --> 12:19.750
Is he looking down on our family?

12:20.910 --> 12:22.520
Where will they dine?

12:22.750 --> 12:24.410
In Fourth Master's quarters.

12:26.510 --> 12:27.960
I see. You may leave.

12:28.030 --> 12:28.550
Yes.

12:32.240 --> 12:33.580
No wonder.

12:33.870 --> 12:34.620
It's definitely

12:34.620 --> 12:36.410
all because of the Ji family.

12:36.870 --> 12:39.200
Zhao is on close terms with Lord Chen.

12:41.320 --> 12:42.750
Mom is far too lenient.

12:43.120 --> 12:44.000
In my opinion,

12:44.020 --> 12:45.120
it's nothing more than master

12:45.120 --> 12:46.120
and servant.

12:46.790 --> 12:47.360
Zhao

12:47.550 --> 12:49.360
is just going to wait on him.

12:49.510 --> 12:50.790
Don't talk nonsense!

12:51.630 --> 12:53.190
He's still in the mansion.

12:55.390 --> 12:56.150
Mother,

12:56.840 --> 12:57.960
I think

12:58.080 --> 13:00.030
it's better we don't greet him.

13:00.030 --> 13:01.830
We rarely have contact with him.

13:02.240 --> 13:03.450
A sudden formal visit

13:03.510 --> 13:05.360
might lead to a misstep in etiquette

13:05.360 --> 13:06.490
and make us look bad.

13:08.750 --> 13:10.320
That's exactly the point.

13:11.720 --> 13:12.580
On normal days,

13:12.600 --> 13:14.150
we have no dealings with him,

13:14.150 --> 13:15.810
yet he shows up out of nowhere.

13:16.320 --> 13:18.120
He must have some hidden intent.

14:00.790 --> 14:01.790
This is too bland.

14:02.320 --> 14:03.390
Third Master likes strong flavors,

14:03.390 --> 14:04.720
especially spicy food.

14:04.870 --> 14:05.870
Add more oil and salt

14:05.870 --> 14:07.000
to taste richer.

14:09.080 --> 14:10.750
Make it five shades heavier

14:11.320 --> 14:12.520
than our usual taste.

14:15.240 --> 14:16.630
Five shades?

14:23.910 --> 14:25.960
My Lord, please.

14:27.030 --> 14:27.510
Good.

14:48.840 --> 14:49.670
Not bad.

14:51.830 --> 14:53.230
You should all try it too.

14:53.320 --> 14:54.210
Okay, okay.

14:54.240 --> 14:54.750
Okay, My Lord.

14:54.750 --> 14:55.240
Good.

15:07.240 --> 15:07.910
Good wine.

15:11.550 --> 15:14.440
This is a twenty-year-old Sangluo wine.

15:14.510 --> 15:16.080
I'm glad you like it, My Lord.

15:16.080 --> 15:16.790
Here.

15:17.440 --> 15:19.300
Allow me to fill your cup, My Lord.

15:21.600 --> 15:23.940
[Sangluo Wine]

15:28.360 --> 15:29.750
Second Master asked to send two more jars

15:29.750 --> 15:31.950
of Sangluo wine to the front courtyard.

15:41.870 --> 15:43.270
He can drink this much?

15:44.720 --> 15:45.320
My Lady,

15:45.910 --> 15:47.870
I'm afraid Third Master and the others
have had too salty food,

15:47.870 --> 15:49.600
and have to drown it in wine now.

15:54.910 --> 15:56.000
Put some more perilla

15:56.000 --> 15:57.150
in this soup.

15:57.510 --> 15:58.200
Yes.

16:06.080 --> 16:06.720
However,

16:06.870 --> 16:09.050
no matter how good the wine is,
one shouldn't drink too much.

16:09.050 --> 16:10.450
It's getting late today.

16:10.790 --> 16:11.480
Let's

16:12.030 --> 16:13.030
stop here for now.

16:13.150 --> 16:14.390
Yes, it is getting late.

16:14.390 --> 16:14.870
My Lord,

16:15.030 --> 16:16.900
if you don't mind, how about

16:17.000 --> 16:17.790
just staying over?

16:17.790 --> 16:19.650
You can go back tomorrow morning.

16:31.200 --> 16:32.060
That works too.

16:32.910 --> 16:33.790
I'm just afraid

16:35.120 --> 16:36.580
it might be inconvenient.

16:38.390 --> 16:39.390
It is convenient.

16:40.120 --> 16:42.170
Nothing could be more convenient.

16:42.390 --> 16:43.790
Someone, hurry!

16:44.200 --> 16:46.060
Go and get the guest courtyard...

16:46.200 --> 16:46.750
No.

16:47.440 --> 16:49.750
Clean up Cuizhu Residence.

16:49.790 --> 16:50.270
Yes.

16:51.120 --> 16:52.240
It's quiet there.

16:52.440 --> 16:53.750
Yes, My Lord.

16:56.870 --> 16:57.510
What?

16:57.870 --> 16:58.750
He stayed?

16:58.870 --> 16:59.600
Yes.

17:00.000 --> 17:01.600
I heard he drank too much.

17:02.510 --> 17:03.840
He's really something.

17:05.030 --> 17:06.510
Is he staying in the guest courtyard?

17:06.510 --> 17:07.880
I'm not sure.

17:08.510 --> 17:09.510
Probably.

17:18.349 --> 17:19.440
Qingpu, come here.

17:20.440 --> 17:20.920
In a while,

17:20.920 --> 17:22.310
sneak over to the guest courtyard,

17:22.310 --> 17:23.750
and check what he is doing.

17:23.750 --> 17:25.720
I'll take a detour
around Cuizhu Residence,

17:25.720 --> 17:27.180
to avoid running into him.

17:27.349 --> 17:28.640
My Lady, you...

17:31.350 --> 17:32.750
Why do you have to do this?

17:32.920 --> 17:34.880
Third Master clearly wants to see you.

17:34.880 --> 17:36.310
And you want to see Third Master too.

17:36.310 --> 17:38.170
Just go quickly when I tell you to.

17:50.830 --> 17:52.760
I can't believe this Chen Yanyun.

17:53.000 --> 17:54.640
It's his first time at our mansion.

17:54.640 --> 17:55.590
Why didn't he think of

17:55.590 --> 17:57.250
coming to pay respects to me?

17:57.790 --> 17:59.040
Mother,

17:59.510 --> 18:01.590
he is a dignified Grand Secretary.

18:01.920 --> 18:03.550
The fact that he's willing
to visit our mansion

18:03.550 --> 18:05.080
is already giving us honor.

18:06.030 --> 18:07.490
I really didn't expect it.

18:08.110 --> 18:10.510
My sister-in-law has already passed away.

18:11.000 --> 18:12.130
How could the Fourth

18:12.680 --> 18:14.830
still connect with Chen?

18:17.110 --> 18:19.270
Thinking back on it now,

18:20.110 --> 18:21.960
right after my sister-in-law passed away,

18:21.960 --> 18:24.090
so many imperial censors impeached him.

18:24.090 --> 18:25.270
If it were anyone else,

18:25.270 --> 18:26.600
this official position

18:26.720 --> 18:29.070
would definitely have been lost.

18:29.790 --> 18:30.400
But

18:30.960 --> 18:33.580
the Fourth unexpectedly remained unscathed

18:33.680 --> 18:36.740
and continued as a Director
in the Ministry of Revenue.

18:37.880 --> 18:39.280
Now that I think about it,

18:39.750 --> 18:40.550
most likely,

18:40.550 --> 18:42.510
this Chen Yanyun was helping him.

18:44.480 --> 18:46.880
But what virtue or ability
does the Fourth have

18:46.880 --> 18:48.070
to make Chen

18:48.310 --> 18:50.510
look upon him with such favor?

18:51.510 --> 18:53.070
I don't know either.

18:53.920 --> 18:55.920
Earlier, Chen drank too much.

18:56.070 --> 18:56.790
I thought

18:56.920 --> 18:58.920
we should escort him back properly.

18:59.510 --> 19:02.200
But the Fourth actually asked Lord Chen

19:02.640 --> 19:04.960
if he wanted to just stay over.

19:05.440 --> 19:07.270
I was startled at the time.

19:07.920 --> 19:09.090
But the thing is,

19:09.440 --> 19:10.510
Chen

19:10.720 --> 19:13.070
actually agreed.

19:15.270 --> 19:16.640
It seems

19:17.070 --> 19:18.200
in the future,

19:18.510 --> 19:21.310
we should treat the fourth branch better.

19:22.160 --> 19:23.050
After this,

19:23.480 --> 19:24.350
who knows,

19:25.070 --> 19:26.510
we might need his help.

19:27.880 --> 19:28.510
Deyuan,

19:29.790 --> 19:30.790
you didn't take

19:30.790 --> 19:32.550
someone's money again, did you?

19:32.550 --> 19:33.440
No.

19:34.790 --> 19:36.820
You must not act foolishly again.

19:37.790 --> 19:38.920
Have you forgotten?

19:39.070 --> 19:39.880
I haven't.

19:41.200 --> 19:41.800
That year,

19:42.110 --> 19:42.720
you took

19:42.720 --> 19:45.030
twenty thousand taels of silver
from the Vice Minister of Works.

19:45.030 --> 19:46.890
The next year he got into trouble.

19:47.310 --> 19:48.880
If I hadn't gone to Madam Ji

19:48.880 --> 19:50.110
to borrow money to cover this deficit,

19:50.110 --> 19:51.790
-you...
-That's enough.

19:52.110 --> 19:52.920
Mother,

19:53.440 --> 19:54.830
these are old, stale matters.

19:54.830 --> 19:56.510
Why bring them up?

19:56.720 --> 19:57.880
I'm reminding you.

19:58.070 --> 19:59.830
An official must be honest and upright.

19:59.830 --> 20:02.760
If household expenses aren't enough,
I have my ways.

20:03.030 --> 20:03.960
Who is there?

20:04.790 --> 20:05.750
Come out quickly!

20:05.750 --> 20:06.310
Who is it?

20:07.160 --> 20:07.880
Go check it.

20:32.400 --> 20:33.160
Don't run!

20:33.640 --> 20:34.750
I see you!

21:10.880 --> 21:11.510
Master.

21:13.480 --> 21:15.960
I just came to check on your Lord.

21:16.350 --> 21:17.920
If he needs anything,

21:18.240 --> 21:20.300
I can order someone to bring it over.

21:23.200 --> 21:25.130
Our Lord has already gone to sleep.

21:26.110 --> 21:26.720
Then,

21:27.640 --> 21:29.160
I will take my leave.

21:51.590 --> 21:52.520
Are you alright?

21:56.350 --> 21:57.270
What happened?

21:57.550 --> 22:00.210
Why are they
making things so difficult for you?

22:01.830 --> 22:02.830
I heard some

22:03.000 --> 22:05.060
private talk I shouldn't have heard.

22:05.550 --> 22:06.480
About Gu Deyuan?

22:13.350 --> 22:16.440
The position of Right Vice Minister
of Personnel is vacant.

22:16.440 --> 22:17.400
This is a good position.

22:17.400 --> 22:18.860
Many people are eyeing it.

22:19.400 --> 22:21.400
Your second uncle is one of them.

22:22.070 --> 22:23.270
He can get it?

22:24.070 --> 22:25.330
There's no hope at all.

22:28.110 --> 22:30.440
If he could just
know his place and lay low,

22:30.590 --> 22:31.720
and not be targeted,

22:32.440 --> 22:33.600
for the Gu family,

22:33.750 --> 22:35.610
it might actually be a good thing.

22:36.390 --> 22:38.590
There's a hidden meaning in your words.

22:39.030 --> 22:40.890
Let's not talk about him anymore.

22:42.440 --> 22:43.110
You...

22:43.880 --> 22:46.140
Shouldn't you be in the guest courtyard?

22:46.240 --> 22:47.590
Why are you here?

22:50.830 --> 22:52.350
So you knew I stayed over.

22:54.440 --> 22:55.720
I'm going back.

23:00.070 --> 23:01.600
We finally managed to meet.

23:02.000 --> 23:03.930
Why are you in such a hurry to leave?

23:05.790 --> 23:06.240
Well, could I

23:06.240 --> 23:07.840
just stay here and not leave?

23:09.790 --> 23:11.320
I won't talk to you anymore.

23:13.510 --> 23:14.750
Is it because you saw me

23:14.750 --> 23:16.410
that you were with that Wang,

23:16.510 --> 23:17.770
laughing and talking?

23:18.350 --> 23:19.350
Nonsense.

23:21.310 --> 23:22.550
He is a guest.

23:27.400 --> 23:28.600
It's really too late.

23:29.160 --> 23:30.310
I have to go.

23:30.310 --> 23:32.350
I have already explained to my mentor.

23:32.350 --> 23:35.480
The marriage between me
and Xue Qinglan is called off.

23:36.470 --> 23:37.530
From now on, he

23:37.720 --> 23:39.980
won't act as a matchmaker for me anymore.

23:41.270 --> 23:41.830
Then,

23:42.350 --> 23:43.510
will the Chief Grand Secretary

23:43.510 --> 23:44.970
be dissatisfied with you?

23:45.240 --> 23:45.960
Perhaps.

23:46.590 --> 23:48.390
But I can't care about that much.

23:52.000 --> 23:53.460
Didn't I tell you already?

23:54.270 --> 23:55.270
Marrying you

23:55.350 --> 23:56.680
brings no benefit to me.

23:58.440 --> 24:00.640
Then what if we set aside those factors?

24:02.160 --> 24:03.690
Just speaking of you and me.

24:04.920 --> 24:05.790
Are you willing

24:06.590 --> 24:07.550
to be with me?

24:20.350 --> 24:22.210
I know what you are worried about.

24:22.840 --> 24:23.590
But could you

24:23.590 --> 24:25.650
hold off on making a decision for now?

24:26.510 --> 24:27.590
When we encounter problems,

24:27.590 --> 24:29.050
let's not rush to retreat.

24:29.110 --> 24:30.110
Let's see if we can

24:30.640 --> 24:32.700
figure out a way to solve it together.

24:33.310 --> 24:34.070
Okay?

24:43.750 --> 24:44.480
Okay.

25:14.170 --> 25:17.170
♪ A good moment is strewn with starlight ♪

25:17.740 --> 25:21.370
♪ Flames burn away
the frost of bygone days ♪

25:22.250 --> 25:26.280
♪ Reflections tremble,
hearts beat in unison ♪

25:27.660 --> 25:30.820
♪ Candlelight weaves the web of fate ♪

25:32.080 --> 25:34.810
♪ Petal shadows
trace the lines of your face ♪

25:35.930 --> 25:39.490
♪ Fleeting light
sketches the shape of fate ♪

25:40.290 --> 25:44.010
♪ Steps are light,
but feelings are hard to hide ♪

25:44.770 --> 25:49.200
♪ In a backward glance,
a few hidden feelings slip through ♪

25:51.790 --> 25:53.600
♪ Ask the passing time
whether it has forgotten ♪

25:54.410 --> 25:56.230
♪ The moonlight of our first encounter ♪

25:57.270 --> 26:00.930
♪ Year after year,
it etches your likeness ♪

26:01.720 --> 26:04.240
♪ Count the faint shimmer
of the starry river ♪

26:05.120 --> 26:08.900
♪ Yet none compares
to the gentle light in your eyes ♪

26:09.600 --> 26:11.860
♪ At last, I see the galaxy
shimmering and swaying ♪

26:12.710 --> 26:14.470
♪ Reflected in our eyes ♪

26:15.340 --> 26:20.000
♪ I'll be with you forever ♪

26:21.150 --> 26:24.650
♪ And enjoy
the beautiful scenery with you ♪

26:26.940 --> 26:30.730
♪ For all the days of our lives,
our love will endure ♪

26:32.290 --> 26:34.560
♪ Ask the passing time
whether it has forgotten ♪

26:35.200 --> 26:36.900
♪ The moonlight of our first encounter ♪

26:37.920 --> 26:41.580
♪ Year after year,
it etches your likeness ♪

26:42.370 --> 26:44.720
♪ Count the faint shimmer
of the starry river ♪

26:45.770 --> 26:49.550
♪ Yet none compares
to the gentle light in your eyes ♪

26:50.250 --> 26:52.510
♪ At last, I see the galaxy
shimmering and swaying ♪

26:53.360 --> 26:55.120
♪ Reflected in our eyes ♪

26:55.990 --> 27:00.650
♪ I'll be with you forever ♪

27:01.600 --> 27:03.590
♪ And enjoy
the beautiful scenery with you ♪

27:04.350 --> 27:05.750
Where is it?

27:11.880 --> 27:12.750
I remember earlier

27:12.750 --> 27:14.030
I dropped it right here.

27:14.030 --> 27:15.620
Why is it gone?

27:16.440 --> 27:18.240
The earrings

27:18.260 --> 27:19.290
were from Wenxiu!

27:34.680 --> 27:35.480
Wait a minute.

27:42.510 --> 27:44.510
Good thing it's not found by others.

27:53.920 --> 27:55.000
About this,

27:55.510 --> 27:57.110
perhaps it's better if I step forward.

27:57.110 --> 27:57.830
No need.

27:58.310 --> 27:59.570
I can handle it myself.

28:01.920 --> 28:02.640
This way.

28:05.720 --> 28:07.000
My Lady!

28:07.510 --> 28:08.240
Look,

28:08.750 --> 28:10.030
isn't that Miss Gu?

28:14.550 --> 28:17.200
Why did she come out of Cuizhu Residence?

28:18.680 --> 28:19.610
That's strange.

28:20.240 --> 28:22.110
Lord Chen is

28:22.110 --> 28:24.510
also staying at Cuizhu Residence tonight.

28:28.590 --> 28:30.030
I knew it!

28:30.550 --> 28:31.510
She is just a half-orphan
whose father doesn't care

28:31.510 --> 28:33.200
and who lost her mother.

28:33.310 --> 28:34.910
How could she be so arrogant?

28:35.070 --> 28:35.590
Also,

28:36.200 --> 28:37.110
why would the Ji family

28:37.110 --> 28:38.680
hand over so many properties
in the capital

28:38.680 --> 28:39.200
to a

28:39.200 --> 28:40.600
girl who just came of age?

28:41.640 --> 28:42.160
Right!

28:44.270 --> 28:45.920
Chen even specially

28:45.920 --> 28:48.380
went to attend her coming-of-age ceremony.

28:49.880 --> 28:51.510
Now it all makes sense.

28:51.830 --> 28:52.960
So,

28:53.720 --> 28:55.650
they have long had a secret affair.

28:56.960 --> 29:00.880
A secret rendezvous late at night
with a current Grand Secretary!

29:02.510 --> 29:04.590
Gu Jinzhao,

29:04.790 --> 29:06.250
you are really something.

29:10.720 --> 29:13.610
[Generations of Excellence]

29:11.310 --> 29:11.920
My Lady,

29:12.110 --> 29:14.310
when is Third Master coming to propose?

29:15.160 --> 29:16.050
Propose?

29:16.110 --> 29:17.750
Third Master is always swift and decisive.

29:17.750 --> 29:18.680
It must be soon.

29:19.510 --> 29:20.640
What proposal?

29:21.000 --> 29:22.110
I haven't completely decided

29:22.110 --> 29:23.040
to marry him yet.

29:23.640 --> 29:25.510
You still haven't decided?

29:25.830 --> 29:26.440
You two...

29:27.000 --> 29:28.440
Haven't you already...

29:31.640 --> 29:32.350
Yes.

29:33.750 --> 29:34.720
We indeed have

29:34.720 --> 29:35.780
already done that.

29:37.270 --> 29:38.070
But that

29:38.400 --> 29:39.000
doesn't mean

29:39.000 --> 29:40.060
I have to marry him.

29:40.720 --> 29:41.720
This is too hasty.

29:42.590 --> 29:44.320
When I usually go to pick a shop,

29:44.440 --> 29:46.240
I even scout the location a few times.

29:46.240 --> 29:48.350
Let alone this is a lifelong matter.

29:50.920 --> 29:51.790
Besides,

29:52.350 --> 29:53.510
he merely said

29:53.550 --> 29:55.000
he knew what I was worried about,

29:55.000 --> 29:57.060
and agreed to figure out a way with me.

29:57.270 --> 29:59.030
He didn't say he would propose.

30:01.920 --> 30:02.650
Don't laugh.

30:09.310 --> 30:10.350
You mentioned earlier

30:10.350 --> 30:12.010
that Uncle Ping sent a letter?

30:12.160 --> 30:14.290
Yes, it just arrived in the afternoon.

30:27.960 --> 30:30.360
There is a drought in Pingyang Prefecture.

30:31.000 --> 30:32.310
Fetch paper and a brush.

30:32.310 --> 30:33.910
I want to reply to the letter.

30:36.470 --> 30:38.790
[Shan]

30:42.190 --> 30:44.600
[Drought in Shanxi]

30:49.370 --> 30:52.430
[Gu]

30:52.650 --> 30:53.590
What did you say?

30:55.090 --> 30:57.090
Zhao and Chen

30:57.710 --> 30:59.250
are having an affair?

31:02.310 --> 31:03.920
Could you have seen it wrong?

31:04.590 --> 31:05.720
How could I?

31:06.030 --> 31:07.330
I saw her with my own eyes

31:07.330 --> 31:08.470
coming out

31:08.490 --> 31:09.400
of Lord Chen's room.

31:09.400 --> 31:10.330
So late at night,

31:10.590 --> 31:11.750
acting all sneaky.

31:11.920 --> 31:14.180
If that's not a secret affair, what is it?

31:14.510 --> 31:16.640
Besides, Xiaotang saw it too.

31:17.030 --> 31:18.030
Right, Xiaotang?

31:21.070 --> 31:22.720
I was wondering
why the person eavesdropping last night

31:22.720 --> 31:23.680
couldn't be found.

31:23.680 --> 31:24.790
It was her.

31:26.750 --> 31:28.350
No wonder!

31:28.780 --> 31:29.910
Why would he suddenly

31:29.910 --> 31:31.960
come to our mansion for no reason?

31:32.640 --> 31:33.500
I really couldn't have imagined.

31:33.500 --> 31:35.160
This Chen, a dignified Grand Secretary,

31:35.160 --> 31:37.070
actually took a fancy to Zhao.

31:38.510 --> 31:39.510
That's not right.

31:41.550 --> 31:43.070
With Chen's status,

31:43.400 --> 31:44.350
he naturally

31:44.350 --> 31:47.480
would want to marry a noble lady
from a prominent family.

31:49.790 --> 31:51.620
He had a first wife before.

31:52.160 --> 31:53.620
This is a second marriage.

31:54.960 --> 31:57.030
Zhao is also a suitable match.

31:59.590 --> 32:00.790
It's still not right.

32:01.440 --> 32:02.880
By acting so secretly,

32:03.550 --> 32:04.400
it's obvious

32:04.400 --> 32:05.440
he doesn't want Zhao

32:05.440 --> 32:07.240
to have a formal, public status.

32:07.310 --> 32:08.970
If not formalized publicly,

32:11.720 --> 32:12.520
wouldn't Zhao

32:12.640 --> 32:14.510
just become a mistress?

32:14.960 --> 32:15.920
Hilarious.

32:16.200 --> 32:17.880
What are you laughing at?

32:18.400 --> 32:20.400
If she becomes someone's mistress,

32:20.590 --> 32:23.120
wouldn't that drag down
your reputation too?

32:24.030 --> 32:24.830
Mother,

32:25.880 --> 32:28.070
even if this Chen is a Grand Secretary,

32:28.070 --> 32:29.000
a daughter of our Gu family

32:29.000 --> 32:30.640
cannot be his mistress!

32:30.920 --> 32:31.750
Not to mention

32:32.000 --> 32:33.920
Lian's reputation being affected,

32:33.920 --> 32:35.580
our Lord in the imperial court

32:35.750 --> 32:37.790
would completely lose all dignity.

32:37.790 --> 32:38.850
Alright, alright.

32:39.880 --> 32:40.750
This matter

32:41.400 --> 32:43.130
must absolutely not be spread.

32:43.510 --> 32:45.510
Not even a single word can be leaked.

32:45.720 --> 32:46.310
Furthermore, you cannot

32:46.310 --> 32:47.880
mention it in front of Zhao.

32:48.830 --> 32:50.550
Why, Grandmother?

32:50.920 --> 32:52.160
Haven't you always

32:52.160 --> 32:53.820
wanted to teach Zhao a lesson?

32:54.000 --> 32:55.460
This is a great opportunity.

32:55.460 --> 32:56.550
What do you know?

32:56.880 --> 32:57.640
What I fear

32:58.030 --> 32:59.110
is not Zhao.

32:59.550 --> 33:01.590
What I fear is Chen.

33:05.070 --> 33:06.130
Listen carefully,

33:06.310 --> 33:07.970
don't cause trouble outside.

33:08.400 --> 33:11.600
Be careful not to bring a great disaster
upon your father.

33:18.120 --> 33:18.790
With such great difficulty,

33:18.790 --> 33:20.550
we caught Gu Jinzhao's weakness,

33:20.550 --> 33:21.110
yet Grandmother actually

33:21.110 --> 33:22.550
forbids me from exposing her.

33:22.550 --> 33:24.080
This is simply outrageous!

33:29.550 --> 33:31.830
Won't let me expose her?

33:35.880 --> 33:36.480
Xiaotang.

33:37.000 --> 33:37.550
My Lady.

33:38.350 --> 33:40.070
Go find a crowded place,

33:40.510 --> 33:42.680
and spread this matter.

33:46.350 --> 33:47.880
But didn't the Old Madam say

33:48.000 --> 33:50.200
we are forbidden from mentioning this?

33:51.400 --> 33:52.750
I didn't tell you to spread the news about

33:52.750 --> 33:54.680
Gu Jinzhao and Chen Yanyun.

33:54.920 --> 33:56.780
You can just swap in someone else!

33:56.830 --> 33:57.310
Right.

33:57.310 --> 33:58.370
Do you understand?

34:04.720 --> 34:07.240
As long as Gu Jinzhao's
reputation is ruined,

34:07.240 --> 34:08.100
perhaps

34:08.130 --> 34:09.860
Chen won't want her anymore.

34:10.030 --> 34:11.110
And the Ji family won't

34:11.110 --> 34:13.110
hand over so many properties to her.

34:14.280 --> 34:15.320
When that happens,

34:15.320 --> 34:16.650
I'll see what she can do!

34:23.510 --> 34:24.310
Third Master.

34:26.320 --> 34:27.690
Of course it's fake.

34:27.880 --> 34:28.880
How could Zhao possibly

34:28.880 --> 34:30.630
have an affair with Wang Zan?

34:33.230 --> 34:34.440
Besides, at the Spring Outing,

34:34.440 --> 34:35.030
she was always

34:35.030 --> 34:36.710
with Qinglan and me the whole time.

34:36.710 --> 34:38.630
She didn't even
say a single word to Wang Zan.

34:38.630 --> 34:39.670
But the rumors are told

34:39.670 --> 34:41.510
so convincingly.

34:42.150 --> 34:44.610
They even said Wang Zan
went to the Gu family.

34:45.190 --> 34:48.320
Not only did they exchange
tokens of affection in private,

34:48.320 --> 34:50.719
he even stayed overnight
at the Gu mansion.

34:50.800 --> 34:53.070
Mother, that sounds
like a rumor right away!

34:53.070 --> 34:54.710
How could you take it seriously?

34:54.710 --> 34:56.960
I hope it's a rumor too.

34:57.050 --> 35:01.060
[Orchid Chamber Fragrance]

35:00.630 --> 35:01.320
Yanyun.

35:05.150 --> 35:05.710
Mother.

35:05.960 --> 35:07.800
You came back quite early today.

35:07.920 --> 35:09.550
I came back to pack some clothes.

35:09.550 --> 35:11.230
These days, I'm afraid every now and then,

35:11.230 --> 35:12.510
I'll have to stay overnight
at Wenyuan Pavilion.

35:12.510 --> 35:13.710
I came to let you know.

35:13.800 --> 35:15.070
Why are you so busy?

35:15.360 --> 35:16.880
There is a drought in Shanxi.

35:16.880 --> 35:18.670
We must prepare for disaster relief.

35:18.670 --> 35:19.630
The peace talks
with the Northern Barbarians

35:19.630 --> 35:21.190
happen to be in Shanxi as well.

35:21.190 --> 35:25.050
The Ministry of War and the Ministry
of Revenue are both in a scramble.

35:25.110 --> 35:25.920
I heard

35:25.920 --> 35:27.280
what you were saying earlier.

35:27.280 --> 35:28.590
The Ji family has worked
for me for many years,

35:28.590 --> 35:29.790
with utmost loyalty.

35:30.000 --> 35:31.150
Old Madam Ji and Mother

35:31.150 --> 35:32.510
are also close childhood friends.

35:32.510 --> 35:33.630
Those things you heard,

35:33.630 --> 35:35.190
words intentionally slandering Miss Gu,

35:35.190 --> 35:36.800
should have been refuted immediately.

35:36.800 --> 35:38.730
Why are you helping to spread them?

35:39.480 --> 35:40.960
At that time,

35:40.960 --> 35:42.760
I refuted them.

35:43.320 --> 35:44.400
I just came back

35:44.400 --> 35:46.260
to chatter with Yanying about it.

35:47.030 --> 35:48.880
It was just a joke.

35:49.230 --> 35:50.710
Why do you get angry?

35:50.840 --> 35:51.710
Better not

35:51.840 --> 35:53.640
to make such jokes in the future.

35:55.190 --> 35:56.280
I still have business to attend to.

35:56.280 --> 35:57.610
I will take my leave now.

36:01.320 --> 36:02.720
Take good care of Mother.

36:03.190 --> 36:03.670
I'm leaving.

36:03.380 --> 36:11.960
[Orchid Chamber Fragrance]

36:04.230 --> 36:04.840
Alright.

36:08.670 --> 36:10.670
He's used to bossing people around,

36:10.760 --> 36:12.590
and now he's lecturing me.

36:13.030 --> 36:13.800
Mother.

36:21.630 --> 36:22.430
Third Master,

36:22.590 --> 36:24.190
Wang Zan is just a scoundrel.

36:24.320 --> 36:25.230
I think this rumor

36:25.230 --> 36:26.230
was spread by him.

36:27.190 --> 36:28.190
Not necessarily.

36:29.000 --> 36:29.670
Those who could spread

36:29.670 --> 36:31.360
such talk about staying overnight
at the Gu family

36:31.360 --> 36:33.160
could only be from the Gu family.

36:34.760 --> 36:36.150
However, for this matter,

36:36.150 --> 36:39.280
the Wang family still needs to
step forward and clarify.

36:40.190 --> 36:40.670
You may

36:41.000 --> 36:42.480
give Mr. Jiang a word of instruction.

36:42.480 --> 36:43.590
He will know what to do.

36:43.590 --> 36:44.070
Yes.

36:46.630 --> 36:48.590
Make another trip to the Gu Mansion.

36:48.590 --> 36:50.280
Ask if Miss Gu has any free time.

36:50.280 --> 36:50.960
Just say,

36:52.000 --> 36:52.930
I want to see her.

36:53.520 --> 36:54.110
Yes.

36:55.440 --> 36:56.240
Wait a minute.

36:59.000 --> 37:00.710
With the rumor spreading like this,

37:00.710 --> 37:02.590
I'm afraid her situation in the Gu family

37:02.590 --> 37:03.590
is getting worse.

37:05.720 --> 37:06.670
Send an invitation to her

37:06.670 --> 37:07.840
under the name of my mother.

37:07.840 --> 37:08.360
Later,

37:08.550 --> 37:09.800
just pick her up.

37:10.880 --> 37:11.480
Okay.

37:15.480 --> 37:16.140
Never mind.

37:16.960 --> 37:18.620
I'd better tell her in person.

37:22.950 --> 37:26.100
[Ji's Silk and Satin]

37:27.190 --> 37:28.190
The Boss is here.

37:31.630 --> 37:32.800
I heard recently,

37:32.880 --> 37:33.630
-a new batch
-Have you heard

37:33.630 --> 37:34.670
-of Zhuanghua satin has arrived.
-about that scandal?

37:34.670 --> 37:36.630
-I want to take a look.
-Such a young girl,

37:36.630 --> 37:37.960
so indiscreet!

37:37.960 --> 37:39.360
Exactly, so indiscreet.

37:39.360 --> 37:40.890
Why is she here at this time?

37:42.320 --> 37:42.880
Boss,

37:43.000 --> 37:43.820
there are many people here.

37:43.820 --> 37:45.000
Why don't you sit in the private room?

37:45.000 --> 37:45.820
No need.

37:46.230 --> 37:47.560
I'll take a look myself.

37:47.630 --> 37:48.400
Do your work.

37:48.760 --> 37:49.670
No need to attend to me.

37:49.670 --> 37:50.190
Yes.

37:57.030 --> 37:58.710
Is she Gu Jinzhao?

37:59.030 --> 38:00.430
She looks decent enough.

38:00.440 --> 38:01.070
How could she do

38:01.070 --> 38:02.400
such a shameless thing?

38:03.190 --> 38:04.110
Not even engaged yet,

38:04.110 --> 38:05.590
and already having
secret rendezvous with a man.

38:05.590 --> 38:08.070
But you have to see
which family the man is from.

38:08.070 --> 38:09.530
Court of Judicial Review!

38:09.630 --> 38:11.090
A family of the third rank!

38:11.190 --> 38:13.280
No matter how rich Gu Jinzhao is,

38:13.300 --> 38:15.510
she is still climbing the social ladder
by aiming for the Wang family.

38:15.510 --> 38:16.880
So of course she has to use some tricks!

38:16.880 --> 38:18.920
It's the family of
Court of Judicial Review?

38:18.920 --> 38:20.000
Is this true?

38:20.510 --> 38:21.670
Of course!

38:21.710 --> 38:23.000
Could my personal maid

38:23.000 --> 38:24.110
possibly lie to me?

38:24.400 --> 38:25.670
She said she saw them

38:25.670 --> 38:27.320
holding hands and strolling in the garden.

38:27.320 --> 38:29.120
Wang Zan even stayed overnight!

38:29.760 --> 38:30.760
Impossible!

38:31.480 --> 38:33.750
Wang Zan admitted it himself!

38:33.960 --> 38:35.920
According to the provisions
of the Great Yan Code,

38:35.920 --> 38:36.860
a rumormonger

38:37.070 --> 38:40.230
gets 100 strokes of the cane
and 3 years of penal servitude.

38:40.230 --> 38:42.190
Those who cause serious consequences,

38:42.190 --> 38:43.400
get 100 strokes of the cane,

38:43.400 --> 38:44.920
and exile to three thousand miles away.

38:44.920 --> 38:46.110
You all stand here,

38:46.360 --> 38:47.670
making up such rumors about me.

38:47.670 --> 38:48.790
Right now, I am

38:49.590 --> 38:50.990
unable to defend myself,

38:51.030 --> 38:52.230
and my heart is ashen.

38:52.920 --> 38:54.130
I'm thinking that in a while,

38:54.130 --> 38:56.070
I might as well go find a white silk cloth

38:56.070 --> 38:57.280
and hang myself.

38:58.830 --> 39:00.510
Then, as for all of you rumormongers,

39:00.510 --> 39:02.630
should you be exiled,

39:02.840 --> 39:04.110
or beheaded?

39:04.440 --> 39:05.190
Beheaded?

39:05.330 --> 39:05.920
What should we do?

39:05.920 --> 39:07.360
Who are you trying to scare?

39:07.360 --> 39:08.220
Looking at you,

39:08.230 --> 39:09.840
you don't look like someone
willing to hang herself.

39:09.840 --> 39:10.400
Exactly.

39:10.730 --> 39:11.900
We said it,

39:11.960 --> 39:12.550
so what?

39:12.880 --> 39:14.000
The people talking
behind your back

39:14.000 --> 39:15.400
are more than just the few of us.

39:15.400 --> 39:16.550
All the officials' family members
in the city

39:16.550 --> 39:18.010
know your bad reputation.

39:18.230 --> 39:18.880
Besides,

39:18.880 --> 39:20.810
we weren't the first ones to say it.

39:21.070 --> 39:21.840
Wang Zan

39:21.840 --> 39:23.190
admitted it himself!

39:23.550 --> 39:24.150
Across the whole city,

39:24.150 --> 39:25.400
many people heard it.

39:25.550 --> 39:26.990
He is right across the street
at Baiweizhai.

39:26.990 --> 39:28.920
If you have the guts, go talk to him!

39:33.120 --> 39:34.180
What are you doing?

39:34.190 --> 39:36.050
Trying to run away after talking?

39:39.990 --> 39:41.010
Didn't you say

39:41.040 --> 39:42.840
that Wang Zan started the rumor?

39:43.110 --> 39:43.670
Good.

39:44.670 --> 39:46.400
I'm going to find him right now.

39:46.880 --> 39:48.710
Then you're coming with me.

39:48.960 --> 39:51.020
And I invite everyone to be a witness.

39:51.630 --> 39:53.380
Now there's a good show to watch!

39:53.380 --> 39:55.180
Let's see if this is really true.

39:57.360 --> 39:59.000
What, you don't dare?

39:59.190 --> 40:00.320
Why wouldn't I dare?

40:00.550 --> 40:01.360
Let's go then.

40:04.840 --> 40:05.510
Miss Gu,

40:06.070 --> 40:06.920
I'm the butler

40:06.920 --> 40:08.380
from Lord Wang's mansion.

40:08.480 --> 40:09.800
Our Lord learned that

40:09.880 --> 40:11.030
the young master offended you.

40:11.030 --> 40:12.510
He has work at the office,

40:12.920 --> 40:14.000
so he ordered me

40:14.440 --> 40:15.900
to apologize to you, Miss.

40:16.400 --> 40:17.320
Apologize?

40:17.900 --> 40:19.550
Even the Wang family's chief butler came.

40:19.550 --> 40:21.480
-Could it be a rumor?
-I don't need your apology.

40:21.480 --> 40:22.760
I want your young master

40:22.760 --> 40:24.110
to come and apologize in person,

40:24.110 --> 40:25.310
clarify it publicly,

40:25.320 --> 40:26.780
and restore my innocence.

40:30.440 --> 40:31.240
Young Master!

40:31.710 --> 40:32.480
Wang Zan!

40:34.800 --> 40:35.590
Is this Wang Zan?

40:35.590 --> 40:36.360
What happened to him?

40:36.360 --> 40:36.920
My father

40:37.880 --> 40:39.410
also wants me to apologize.

40:42.760 --> 40:43.920
Who exactly

40:43.920 --> 40:45.190
did I mess with?

40:50.400 --> 40:51.190
Miss Gu,

40:52.320 --> 40:53.110
I was wrong.

40:53.710 --> 40:55.040
I was completely wrong.

40:55.800 --> 40:56.440
Everyone,

40:56.960 --> 40:57.630
everyone,

40:58.760 --> 40:59.760
Miss Gu has never had

40:59.760 --> 41:00.760
a secret rendezvous with me.

41:00.760 --> 41:02.850
My proposal was rejected by her.

41:03.000 --> 41:04.150
I held a grudge,

41:04.150 --> 41:05.500
and talked nonsense,

41:05.670 --> 41:06.730
spouting rubbish.

41:07.550 --> 41:08.190
Miss Gu,

41:08.670 --> 41:10.000
the rumors in the capital

41:10.000 --> 41:12.200
all started because of my wicked mouth.

41:12.320 --> 41:14.580
But now I have fully realized my mistake.

41:14.960 --> 41:15.590
Please,

41:17.840 --> 41:19.120
Miss Gu, forgive me.

41:19.320 --> 41:20.880
To think he'd do such a thing!

41:20.880 --> 41:21.730
It's despicable.

41:21.730 --> 41:22.760
Ruining other's reputation!

41:22.760 --> 41:23.480
He really deserves a beating.

41:23.480 --> 41:24.940
-Exactly.
-That's right.

41:55.440 --> 41:57.260
Old Madam, Old Madam!

41:57.480 --> 41:58.110
Old Madam!

42:06.630 --> 42:07.430
What's wrong?

42:14.630 --> 42:15.670
Is this true?

42:15.920 --> 42:16.710
It's true!

42:16.840 --> 42:17.590
Everyone is saying

42:17.590 --> 42:18.930
Miss Zhao and Mr. Wang

42:18.960 --> 42:20.070
had a secret affair.

42:20.070 --> 42:20.760
They also said

42:20.760 --> 42:22.510
Mr. Wang stayed overnight in our mansion

42:22.510 --> 42:23.320
and Miss Zhao

42:23.320 --> 42:25.580
went to Cuizhu Residence at night alone.

42:27.480 --> 42:28.810
They actually said Zhao

42:29.280 --> 42:30.920
went to Cuizhu Residence?

42:35.630 --> 42:36.840
What an evil girl!

42:38.280 --> 42:39.880
Totally ignoring my words!

42:41.550 --> 42:42.710
Call Lian here!

42:44.110 --> 42:45.110
What does this have

42:45.110 --> 42:45.970
to do with Lian?

42:46.030 --> 42:46.830
Could it be...

42:47.710 --> 42:48.840
If not her, who else?

42:50.510 --> 42:51.770
Then did the Yao family

42:52.030 --> 42:53.550
also hear some rumors?

42:53.920 --> 42:55.190
Most likely they know.

42:56.630 --> 42:57.440
Stupid!

42:58.230 --> 42:59.550
Utterly stupid!

43:00.550 --> 43:01.760
Call her over! Go call her!

43:01.760 --> 43:02.360
Yes.

43:03.670 --> 43:04.510
Grandmother,

43:05.230 --> 43:06.070
look at the hairpin

43:06.070 --> 43:07.200
Wenxiu just gave me.

43:07.280 --> 43:08.280
Does it look good?

43:09.170 --> 43:10.830
You've come at the right time.

43:13.320 --> 43:14.190
Grandmother,

43:14.880 --> 43:16.740
why... why are you hitting me?

43:16.800 --> 43:18.510
Kneel down! Kneel down!

43:22.230 --> 43:22.630
I...

43:23.960 --> 43:25.360
Who else would I hit but you?

43:25.360 --> 43:27.760
Do you still consider me your grandmother?

43:28.400 --> 43:29.710
How did I instruct you?

43:30.590 --> 43:31.700
You must not talk

43:31.760 --> 43:34.060
about Zhao and Chen outside!

43:34.320 --> 43:35.140
And what did you do?

43:35.140 --> 43:37.310
Playing smart behind my back outside!

43:39.480 --> 43:40.610
I didn't!

43:40.880 --> 43:41.840
It wasn't me who said it!

43:41.840 --> 43:42.700
If not you, who?

43:43.550 --> 43:46.590
Wang stayed overnight at Cuizhu Residence?

43:47.000 --> 43:48.170
Did you think that

43:48.230 --> 43:50.410
by changing Chen Yanyun to Wang Zan,

43:50.550 --> 43:52.550
others wouldn't find out it was you?

43:53.590 --> 43:54.400
Find out?

43:55.800 --> 43:56.850
How could she?

43:57.760 --> 43:59.110
What evidence does she have to prove

43:59.110 --> 44:00.190
that I said it?

44:00.280 --> 44:00.760
You!

44:05.280 --> 44:06.280
Miss Gu,

44:10.710 --> 44:12.920
my master invites you over to talk.

44:44.510 --> 44:45.400
At this hour,

44:45.400 --> 44:47.330
did you just come out of the palace?

44:49.360 --> 44:50.440
I'm about to go in.

44:51.960 --> 44:53.070
Recently,

44:53.670 --> 44:55.800
I may have to rest at Wenyuan Pavilion.

44:55.880 --> 44:57.230
I was a bit worried about you,

44:57.230 --> 44:58.290
so I came to see you.

45:01.440 --> 45:03.510
Did you also hear the rumors?

45:04.550 --> 45:05.750
You've been wronged.

45:09.000 --> 45:10.550
Did Wang Shenzhi

45:10.670 --> 45:12.530
send someone to apologize to you?

45:12.710 --> 45:13.360
Yes.

45:15.000 --> 45:16.030
You arranged it?

45:18.110 --> 45:19.440
How did you manage that?

45:20.030 --> 45:21.030
He is a third-rank

45:21.030 --> 45:22.550
Chief Minister
of the Court of Judicial Review!

45:22.550 --> 45:24.150
I have evidence against him.

45:24.400 --> 45:26.000
In the 29th year of Jingning,

45:26.070 --> 45:27.950
when he was the county magistrate
in Wanping,

45:27.950 --> 45:28.710
at that time,

45:29.110 --> 45:30.570
a wealthy man surnamed Liu

45:30.880 --> 45:31.920
committed a crime.

45:31.920 --> 45:33.480
He was supposed to be exiled,

45:33.480 --> 45:34.630
but Wang Shenzhi

45:35.070 --> 45:36.210
exonerated him,

45:36.360 --> 45:37.840
reducing it to half a year in prison,

45:37.840 --> 45:40.070
and accepted three thousand taels
of silver.

45:40.070 --> 45:41.070
You know all this?

45:41.840 --> 45:42.880
How did you know?

45:43.440 --> 45:44.320
Actually,

45:45.150 --> 45:46.320
I'll tell you later.

45:49.070 --> 45:50.400
Keeping me in suspense.

46:05.130 --> 46:08.560
[A Splendid Match]
